# M4: ad-hoc signed .zip release output (scripts/build-release-zip.sh,
# #25/#30 install/uninstall follow-up) — built locally / attached to
# GitHub Releases, not vendored. Formerly a .dmg (.build-dmg/); replaced
# after real-machine testing found Gatekeeper has no GUI bypass at all
# for an ad-hoc signed, quarantined app on macOS 15+ — see
# scripts/install-nagi.sh's header for the full story.
.build-release/

# Vendored Mozc protobufs (regenerated locally)
poc/Sources/NagiMozcProto/Generated/
poc/.mozc-proto/

# M4: emoji shortcode dictionary (#19), built from CLDR by
# scripts/fetch-emoji-annotations.sh — not vendored, same policy as the
# Mozc protobufs above.
.emoji-fetch/
app/Resources/emoji-shortcodes.json

# M2b: full google/mozc checkout used to build our own mozc_server
# (Bazel + third_party_cache can grow to several GB) — see issue #9.
.mozc-build/

